{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01304",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 2.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.55,
      "end_seconds": 7.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.16,
      "end_seconds": 15.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.64,
      "end_seconds": 19.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.88,
      "end_seconds": 24.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Not great, uh, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.65,
      "end_seconds": 29.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "What do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 30.22,
      "end_seconds": 35.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Doctor, it's a dry cough in the evenings. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.26,
      "end_seconds": 40.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.15,
      "end_seconds": 47.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "It's been going on for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.47,
      "end_seconds": 57.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.53,
      "end_seconds": 71.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.07,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day. Pollen season definitely sets it off. I get some relief from antihistamine. A six out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.35,
      "end_seconds": 80.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 80.28,
      "end_seconds": 85.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.93,
      "end_seconds": 89.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.99,
      "end_seconds": 94.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What about itchy eyes, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.5,
      "end_seconds": 97.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Yes, for one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.34,
      "end_seconds": 106.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "Have you had a dry cough in the evenings before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.85,
      "end_seconds": 111.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last year. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 112.15,
      "end_seconds": 115.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.25,
      "end_seconds": 121.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.3,
      "end_seconds": 138.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.58,
      "end_seconds": 141.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.49,
      "end_seconds": 164.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.88,
      "end_seconds": 167.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.54,
      "end_seconds": 175.69,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "You can relax now. Any wheeze, fever or shortness of breath at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.45,
      "end_seconds": 189.5,
      "duration_seconds": 12.05,
      "text": "No, no wheeze, no fever, no shortness of breath. I did have sneezing fits at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.14,
      "end_seconds": 192.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.13,
      "end_seconds": 195.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.15,
      "end_seconds": 200.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.21,
      "end_seconds": 203.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.22,
      "end_seconds": 206.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 208.55,
      "end_seconds": 226.91,
      "duration_seconds": 18.36,
      "text": "Okay, so he is on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety, I give it to him. He is on loratadine, 10 milligrams, once a day, I give it to him."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.9,
      "end_seconds": 232.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.78,
      "end_seconds": 246.96,
      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "text": "So, yes, erythromycin, it gives me a rash. Yes, diclofenac. I've no idea what the reaction was, only that I'm not supposed to have it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.3,
      "end_seconds": 254.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.78,
      "end_seconds": 261.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "Yes, I had my appendix taken out, when I was in my twenties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.41,
      "end_seconds": 267.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.02,
      "end_seconds": 279.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.49,
      "text": "I've had eczema, yes. I've got diabetes. My neighbour said I should get it looked at. I have anxiety, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.47,
      "end_seconds": 288.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes is known to us, good to have that clear. Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 290.51,
      "end_seconds": 293.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.56,
      "end_seconds": 304.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.06,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with seasonal hay fever causing the cough. I can't rule out early asthma yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.49,
      "end_seconds": 308.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.85,
      "end_seconds": 315.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like seasonal hay fever causing the cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.06,
      "end_seconds": 344.03,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.48,
      "end_seconds": 349.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}